:**\nI should check here because: (1) My Ace-high has showdown value against missed draws and lower high cards, (2) Any bet is essentially a bluff since I have no made hand, (3) The opponent's passive play suggests they're also weak, and (4) Risking chips with a bluff when I can check for free doesn't make sense, especially when I'm ahead in the overall match.\n\n**Answer:** 0"}
